      "title": "Scope",
      "content": "Scope: This Indian Standard (IS 15298 (Part 2) : 2016) covers and specifies requirements for Personal Protective Equipment - Safety Footwear (Second Revision). It applies to safety_footwear under personal_protective_equipment category in the mechanical_automotive domain.",
